# ディスク操作の〈形式を新しくする〉 (design 11.26, 7.3) away from a link:
# the system's disk, of version 5 as a build makes it (and as the start
# leaves one of version 4, converting it before it is attached), so the
# program says in its panel that its format is the new one and does
# nothing. The first window is made larger; ディスク操作 is at 440,480
# the first time the menu opens at 400,300, its submenu 接続, 切り離し, 状態表示, 区画作成, 拡張,
# 形式を新しくする, 20 pixels apart from 481.
click 250 60
wait 300
drag 346 222 620 420
wait 500
click 400 300 1
wait 300
move 430 480
wait 150
move 440 480
wait 300
move 510 480
wait 150
move 530 481
wait 300
move 530 581
wait 300
shot disk_convert_menu
click 530 581
expect diskop: started disk.convert
expect disk: form vblka2 is of version 5
expect diskop: convert vblka2 is of version 5, the system's
expect diskop: ディスク「TessronOS system」は新しい形式です
wait 800
shot disk_convert_system
key 28
absent diskop: up convert
